    // Overview page
    "Organizations are rushing to integrate Large Language Models (LLMs) in order to improve their online customer experience. This exposes them to web LLM attacks that take advantage of the model's access to data, APIs, or user information that an attacker cannot access directly. For example, an attack may:" => 'Banyak organisasi mengintegrasikan Large Language Model (LLM) untuk meningkatkan layanan daring mereka. Integrasi ini membuka celah serangan Web LLM yang menyalahgunakan akses model terhadap data maupun API internal yang seharusnya tertutup bagi penyerang, misalnya untuk:',
    "Retrieve data that the LLM has access to. Common sources of such data include the LLM's prompt, training set, and APIs provided to the model." => 'Mengambil data sensitif yang dapat diakses model dari prompt sistem, set pelatihan, atau API internal.',
    'Trigger harmful actions via APIs. For example, the attacker could use an LLM to perform a SQL injection attack on an API it has access to.' => 'Memicu tindakan berbahaya melalui pemanggilan API, seperti menyuruh LLM menjalankan payload SQL injection ke layanan backend.',
