    'What is a large language model?' => 'Apa itu Large Language Model (LLM)?',
    'Large Language Models (LLMs) are AI algorithms that can process user inputs and create plausible responses by predicting sequences of words. They are trained on huge semi-public data sets, using machine learning to analyze how the component parts of language fit together.' => 'Large Language Model (LLM) adalah model kecerdasan buatan yang memproses teks masukan dan menyusun respons alami berdasarkan pola statistik bahasa dari himpunan data latih berskala besar.',
    'LLMs usually present a chat interface to accept user input, known as a prompt. The input allowed is controlled in part by input validation rules.' => 'Aplikasi umumnya menghubungkan pengguna ke LLM melalui antarmuka obrolan yang menerima masukan berupa prompt.',
