    'LLM attacks and prompt injection' => 'Serangan LLM dan prompt injection',
    "Many web LLM attacks rely on a technique known as prompt injection. This is where an attacker uses crafted prompts to manipulate an LLM's output. Prompt injection can result in the AI taking actions that fall outside of its intended purpose, such as making incorrect calls to sensitive APIs or returning content that does not correspond to its guidelines." => 'Sebagian besar serangan Web LLM bertumpu pada prompt injection, yakni merangkai instruksi khusus agar LLM menyimpang dari batasannya, membocorkan aturan internal, atau memanggil API sensitif di luar izin.',
    'Detecting LLM vulnerabilities' => 'Mendeteksi kerentanan LLM',
    'Our recommended methodology for detecting LLM vulnerabilities is:' => 'Metodologi pengujian kerentanan integrasi LLM meliputi tiga langkah:',
    "Identify the LLM's inputs, including both direct (such as a prompt) and indirect (such as training data) inputs." => 'Petakan seluruh masukan model, baik langsung dari obrolan maupun tidak langsung dari konten eksternal.',
    'Work out what data and APIs the LLM has access to.' => 'Identifikasi sumber data, fungsi, dan API apa saja yang terhubung ke model.',
