    "For example, an LLM might not sanitize JavaScript in its responses. In this case, an attacker could potentially cause the LLM to return a JavaScript payload using a crafted prompt, resulting in XSS when the payload is parsed by the victim's browser." => 'Jika aplikasi merender jawaban LLM langsung ke DOM HTML tanpa escaping, penyerang bisa memaksa model menghasilkan payload JavaScript dan memicu XSS.',

