    'Indirectly, where an attacker delivers the prompt via an external source. For example, the prompt could be included in training data or output from an API call.' => 'Tidak langsung (indirect), dengan menanam instruksi tersembunyi di halaman web, email, komentar produk, atau keluaran API yang dibaca oleh LLM.',
    'Indirect prompt injection often enables web LLM attacks on other users. For example, if a user asks an LLM to describe a web page, a hidden prompt inside that page might make the LLM reply with an XSS payload designed to exploit the user.' => 'Teknik ini memungkinkan penyerang menyerang pengguna lain saat asisten AI mereka merangkum halaman web atau ulasan yang berisi instruksi rahasia.',
    'Likewise, a prompt within an email could attempt to make the LLM create a malicious email-forwarding rule, routing subsequent emails to the attacker. For example:' => 'Contoh lain: pesan tersembunyi di dalam email memicu asisten email korban memanggil fungsi penerusan email secara diam-diam:',
    'The way that an LLM is integrated into a website can have a significant effect on how easy it is to exploit indirect prompt injection. When integrated correctly, an LLM can "understand" that it should ignore instructions from within a web-page or email.' => 'Jika model terlatih memisahkan data pasif dan perintah, instruksi langsung dalam teks halaman sering diabaikan.',
