    'Training data poisoning' => 'Peracunan data latih (training data poisoning)',
    'Training data poisoning is a type of indirect prompt injection in which the data the model is trained on is compromised. This can cause the LLM to return intentionally wrong or otherwise misleading information.' => 'Peracunan data latih merusak himpunan data pelatihan model sehingga menghasilkan jawaban menyesatkan atau bias berbahaya.',
    'This vulnerability can arise for several reasons, including:' => 'Risiko ini kerap muncul karena dua hal:',
