    'Leaking sensitive training data' => 'Kebocoran data latih sensitif',
    'An attacker may be able to obtain sensitive data used to train an LLM via a prompt injection attack.' => 'Penyerang dapat memancing LLM membocorkan data rahasia yang ikut terbawa ke dalam data pelatihan atau penyetelan model.',
    'One way to do this is to craft queries that prompt the LLM to reveal information about its training data. For example, you could ask it to complete a phrase by prompting it with some key pieces of information. This could be:' => 'Caranya adalah memberi awalan kalimat kunci agar model melengkapinya dari memori latihnya:',
